MODULE 4: GENERATIVE AI
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

INTRODUCTION: 

- Generative artificial intelligence (AI) is a powerful and exciting type of AI that generates
    new, original content, such as images, music, videos, data, code, responses to questions, and
    a whole lot more. It’s a technology that is revolutionizing the way people live, work, and
    enjoy their leisure time. In this module, you’ll learn the foundational concepts of generative
    AI.


LEARNING OBJECTIVES:

- After completing this module, you should be able to:
    -> Define generative AI
    -> Describe how generative AI works
    -> Identify some examples of generative AI applications
    -> Describe the impact of generative AI to businesses
    -> Identify some current limitations of generative AI